Source: Direct Email
Subject: August Team Retreat - U.S. Chamber of Commerce (CCMC)
From: "Sutherlin, Erin" <ESutherlin@uschamber.com>
Message:
Hello Mangia,

I hope you are all well. We enjoy your help in February that we would like to use your services again in August for our CCMC retreat. Would you be available to help? We are hoping to do food and an activity for a team of 7.  Please let me know and will share more information.

Best,
Erin

Erin Sutherlin
Associate Manager, Center for Capital Markets Competitiveness (CCMC)
U.S. Chamber of Commerce
ESutherlin@USChamber.com<mailto:ESutherlin@USChamber.com>
202.525.8681
[cid:image001.png@01DD1516.0F067C50]

